    "All 26 named lock locations in the Parks Canada traveller portal are retained; Nicholsons and Beveridges each have separate upper/lower operational entries.",
    "The historical 47-lock count includes the Hogs Back guard chamber and the two Tay Canal locks, while Smiths Falls Combined is one modern chamber.",
    "Bridge list reflects named rows in the 2026 traveller portal, not a full authoritative inventory of every possible navigational crossing.",
    "Only 7 individually verified official profile locations receive coordinates or visitor recommendations. Other entries remain in the text directory without inferred map pins.",
    "The 2026 portal's shutdown records are historical and cannot establish 2027 operating status."
